				$(".ultime_gare div").show()
			} else {

				$(".ultime_gare div[data_gara=\"" + data_select + "\"]").show();

			}
		});

	});
</script>

<script>
	var times = document.getElementsByClassName("accordion");
	var i;

	for (i = 0; i < times.length; i++) {
		times[i].addEventListener("click", function() {
			this.classList.toggle("active");
			var panel = this.nextElementSibling;
			if (panel.style.display === "block") {

				panel.style.display = "none";
			} else {
				panel.style.display = "block";
			}
		});
	}

	function sortStyles(a, b) {
		var array_stili_sort = ["50 m Stile Libero", "100 m Stile Libero", "200 m Stile Libero",
			"400 m Stile Libero", "800 m Stile Libero", "1500 m Stile Libero", "50 m Dorso", "100 m Dorso",
			"200 m Dorso", "50 m Rana", "100 m Rana", "200 m Rana", "50 m Farfalla", "100 m Farfalla", "200 m Farfalla",
			"100 m Misti", "200 m Misti", "400 m Misti", "4x50 m Stile Libero", "4x100 m Stile Libero", "4x200 m Stile Libero", "4x50 m Misti", "4x100 m Misti"
		];
		var index_a = array_stili_sort.indexOf(a);

		var index_b = array_stili_sort.indexOf(b);
		if (index_a < index_b) {
			return -1;
		}
		if (index_a > index_b) {
			return 1;
		}
	}

	//funzione che torna le prime lettere delle parole in Uppercase
	function titleCase(str) {
		var splitStr = str.toLowerCase().split(' ');
		for (var i = 0; i < splitStr.length; i++) {
			// You do not need to check if i is larger than splitStr length, as your for does that for you
			// Assign it back to the array
			splitStr[i] = splitStr[i].charAt(0).toUpperCase() + splitStr[i].substring(1);
		}
		// Directly return the joined string
		return splitStr.join(' ');
	}

	function bind_accordion() {

		var acc = document.getElementsByClassName("accordion");
		var i;

		for (i = 0; i < acc.length; i++) {

			acc[i].addEventListener("click", function() {
				this.classList.toggle("active");
				var panel = this.nextElementSibling;
				if (panel.style.display === "block") {

					panel.style.display = "none";
				} else {

					panel.style.display = "block";
				}
			});
		}
	}

	function openIntertempi(id) {
		var div = document.getElementById(id);
		var panel = document.getElementsByClassName("intertempi_div" + id);
		for (let index = 0; index < panel.length; index++) {
			if (panel[index].style.display === "block") {

				panel[index].style.display = "none";
			} else {

				panel[index].style.display = "block";
			}

		}

	}

	function msToTime(msDurata) {

		var millisecondi = parseInt((msDurata % 1000) / 100),
			secondi = parseInt((msDurata / 1000) % 60),
			minuti = parseInt((msDurata / (1000 * 60)) % 60),
			ore = parseInt((msDurata / (1000 * 60 * 60)) % 24);

		ore = (ore < 10) ? "0" + ore : ore;
		minuti = (minuti < 10) ? "0" + minuti : minuti;
		secondi = (secondi < 10) ? "0" + secondi : secondi;

		return ore + ":" + minuti + ":" + secondi + "." + millisecondi;

	}

	function changeFormatDate(check) {

		var data = check.split("-");
		var data1 = data.reverse();
		var dataNormal = data1[0] + "-" + data1[1] + "-" + data1[2];

		return dataNormal;

	}

	//funzione che restituisce array senza ripetizioni
	function onlyUnique(value, index, self) {
		return self.indexOf(value) === index;
	}

